  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Resilience Initiative for Entrepreneurs (ARIE)-The Smile Shop Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Smile Shop&apos;s proposed project will focus on providing access to quality, affordable dental services, and modern oral hygiene accessories. The project hopes to improve community dental awareness through rural dental outreach, radio programs, and school visits. The project will be located in Kano, Nigeria.</narrative>
